### Output configuration
#
# Run `swaymsg -t get_outputs` to list connected outputs and their modes.

# Built-in display: a 3840x2160 Sharp panel (Dell laptop).
#
# scale 2 gives a 1920x1080 logical size, which is what everything else in this
# repo is sized against — waybar's 45px width and 12px font, foot's size=11.
#
# Stock left this file as comments only. The scale was being applied by
# autodetection, which meant it worked on this machine and would silently not
# reproduce elsewhere. Declared explicitly so it is part of the config rather
# than a property of the hardware.
output eDP-1 {
    scale 2
    position 0 0
}

# The background for all outputs is set in config.d/theme, alongside the rest of
# the Nord palette, rather than here.
#
# kanshi (~/.config/kanshi/config) handles per-arrangement geometry on hotplug;
# the eDP-1 block above is the baseline for when kanshi has no matching profile.

# Workspace pinning. 1-5 live on the laptop panel; 6-10 prefer an external
# display and fall back to eDP-1 when none is attached — sway ignores an output
# name that is not currently connected, so this is safe when undocked.
workspace 1 output eDP-1
workspace 2 output eDP-1
workspace 3 output eDP-1
workspace 4 output eDP-1
workspace 5 output eDP-1
workspace 6 output HDMI-A-1 DP-1 eDP-1
workspace 7 output HDMI-A-1 DP-1 eDP-1
workspace 8 output HDMI-A-1 DP-1 eDP-1
workspace 9 output HDMI-A-1 DP-1 eDP-1
workspace 10 output HDMI-A-1 DP-1 eDP-1

